function rewardLabel(reward){if(!reward)return"";return reward.type==="ticket"?`${reward.amount} 抽卡券`:`随机${RARITY_LABEL[reward.rarity]}卡 ×1`;}
function renderSign(){
  traceOverlay("sign");ctx.fillStyle="#050712ee";
  ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);
  const layout=SIGN_LAYOUT,m=layout.margin,y=safeTop+layout.topOffset;
  const rewards=state.config.signIn.firstCycle;
  const rewardListHeight=rewards.length*layout.rewardRowHeight+(rewards.length-1)*layout.rewardGap;
  const firstCycleHeight=layout.headerHeight+rewardListHeight+layout.actionGap+layout.actionHeight+layout.footerHeight+layout.bottomPadding;
  const completedHeight=300;
  const h=state.signStatus.firstCycle?firstCycleHeight:completedHeight;
  box(m,y,W-m*2,h,17,gradient(y,h,"#302759","#11162d"),"#7d69bc");
  text("七日签到",W/2,y+35,24,"#f4ecff","center",800);
  text("按北京时间自然日刷新",W/2,y+60,10,"#aeb4d2","center");
  if(state.signStatus.firstCycle){
    const start=y+layout.headerHeight,row=layout.rewardRowHeight;
    rewards.forEach((reward,i)=>{
      const done=i<state.player.signIn.firstCycleDay,current=i===state.player.signIn.firstCycleDay;
      const rowY=start+i*(row+layout.rewardGap);
      box(m+15,rowY,W-m*2-30,row,9,current?"#4e417a":done?"#263047":"#1c2139",current?"#e4c878":"#424c6c");
      text(`Day ${i+1}`,m+28,rowY+row/2,12,done?"#7f89a6":"#fff","left",700);
      text(rewardLabel(reward),W-m-28,rowY+row/2,11,current?"#f0d68b":"#b8bed8","right");
    });
  }else{
    text("首轮七日奖励已完成",W/2,y+115,18,"#eee7ff","center",700);
    text("今后每日固定领取 5 抽卡券",W/2,y+155,13,"#d9c382","center");
  }
  const buttonY=y+h-layout.footerHeight-layout.bottomPadding-layout.actionHeight;
  button("claimSign",m+18,buttonY,W-m*2-36,layout.actionHeight,state.signStatus.claimedToday?"今日已签到":"领取签到奖励","",!state.signStatus.claimedToday&&!state.loading);
  text("点击面板外空白处关闭",W/2,y+h-layout.bottomPadding-9,10,"#858dac","center");
  hit("closeSign",0,0,W,y);
  hit("closeSign",0,y+h,W,H-y-h);
  hit("closeSign",0,y,m,h);
  hit("closeSign",W-m,y,m,h);
}

function renderHistory(){serviceBg();const top=header("召唤记录","最近 100 批 · 云端最多保存 2000 批"),m=12,row=66;let content=0;state.history.forEach(item=>content+=row+(state.expandedHistory===item._id?Math.ceil(item.results.length/5)*56+10:0));state.maxScroll=Math.max(0,content-(H-top-safeBottom));ctx.save();ctx.beginPath();ctx.rect(0,top,W,H-top-safeBottom);ctx.clip();let y=top-state.scrollY;state.history.forEach(item=>{const expanded=state.expandedHistory===item._id,h=row+(expanded?Math.ceil(item.results.length/5)*56+10:0);box(m,y,W-m*2,h,10,"#111a39e8","#6473a5");text(item.poolName||"签到奖励",m+12,y+19,13,"#fff","left",700);text(`${item.drawType} · 最高 ${RARITY_LABEL[item.highestRarity]}`,m+12,y+42,10,"#d1d6e9");text(new Date(item.createdAt).toLocaleString(),W-m-12,y+19,9,"#aeb7d8","right");clippedHit("expandHistory",m,y,W-m*2,row,item._id,top,H-safeBottom);if(expanded)item.results.forEach((r,i)=>{const x=m+12+(i%5)*((W-m*2-24)/5),cy=y+row+Math.floor(i/5)*56;drawCardSigil(r,x+20,cy+15,18,(COLORS[r.rarity]||COLORS.common).accent);text(fit(r.name,54,8),x+20,cy+37,8,"#ddd","center");if(r.pityTriggered||r.tenGuarantee)text(r.pityTriggered?"40保底":"十连保底",x+20,cy+50,7,"#f0cd78","center");});y+=h+7;});if(!state.history.length)text("暂无召唤记录",W/2,top+70,12,"#d0d5eb","center");ctx.restore();scrollBar(top);}

function render(){state.hit=[];state.cardHits=[];state.battleDragHits=[];state.skillHits=[];state.player=state.player||emptyPlayer();if(state.screen==="collection")renderCollection();else if(state.screen==="forge")renderForge();else if(state.screen==="history")renderHistory();else if(state.screen==="balanceNotices")renderBalanceNotices();else if(state.screen==="shop")renderShop();else if(state.screen==="mail")renderMail();else if(state.screen==="tasks")renderTasks();else if(state.screen==="achievements")renderAchievements();else if(state.screen==="decks")renderDecks();else if(state.screen==="deckEditor")renderDeckEditor();else if(state.screen==="battleSetup")renderBattleSetup();else if(state.screen==="battle")renderBattle();else if(state.screen==="battleHistory")renderBattleHistory();else renderHome();if(state.screen==="collection"&&state.showCollectionFilters)renderCollectionFilters();if(state.showResults)renderResults();if(state.showSign)renderSign();if(state.showCardDetail)renderCardDetail();if(state.battleSkillDetail){traceOverlay("battle-skill-detail");ctx.fillStyle="#030611b8";ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);box(24,H/2-48,W-48,96,14,"#151d36f5","#8e7bc7");text(state.battleSkillDetail.name,W/2,H/2-18,17,"#fff","center",800);text(state.battleSkillDetail.text,W/2,H/2+17,11,"#d9def2","center",600);}if(state.loading&&state.screen!=="battle"){traceOverlay("loading");ctx.fillStyle="#05071388";ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);text("云端处理中…",W/2,H/2,18,"#fff","center",700);}if(state.error&&!state.loading)text(fit(state.error,W-30,9),W/2,H-safeBottom-36,9,"#ef9191","center");}

function clearBattleDrag(){state.battleDrag=null;}
function resetOverlays(){state.showCardDetail=false;state.detailCard=null;state.detailHold=false;state.detailRect=null;state.battleSkillDetail=null;state.battleNotice="";state.battleNoticeUntil=0;state.battleGraveyard.open=false}
function switchScreen(screen){clearBattleDrag();resetOverlays();if(screen==="collection")resetCollectionState();state.screen=screen;state.scrollY=0;state.maxScroll=0;render();}
function doDraw(count){if(!state.selectedPoolId){wx.showToast({title:"请先选择卡池",icon:"none"});return;}const pool=state.pools.find(item=>item.id===state.selectedPoolId);if(pool&&pool.enabled===false){wx.showToast({title:"该卡池暂未开放",icon:"none"});return;}call(api.drawCards(state.selectedPoolId,count),result=>{state.results=(result.results||[]).map(item=>({...item.card,shiny:Boolean(item.shiny),pityTriggered:item.pityTriggered,tenGuarantee:item.tenGuarantee}));state.resultLabel=result.batch.drawType;state.showResults=true;});}
function doWorkshop(data){const card=state.cards.find(c=>c.id===data.cardId)||{};if(data.action==="disassemble"){call(api.workshopAction(data.action,data.cardId,data.shiny),()=>wx.showToast({title:`分解「${card.name}」成功`,icon:"success"}));return;}call(api.workshopAction(data.action,data.cardId,data.shiny),()=>wx.showToast({title:data.action==="craft"?"合成成功":"闪耀合成成功",icon:"success"}));}
function claimSign(){call(api.claimSignIn(),result=>{state.signStatus=result.status;wx.showToast({title:result.card?`获得 ${result.card.name}`:`获得 ${result.reward.amount} 抽卡券`,icon:"success"});});}
function loadHistory(){call(api.loadDrawHistory(),result=>{state.history=result.history;switchScreen("history");});}
function markLatestBalanceNoticeRead(notice){if(!notice||!state.balanceNotices.latest||notice.id!==state.balanceNotices.latest.id||!state.hasUnreadBalanceNotice)return;api.markBalanceNoticeRead(notice.id).then(result=>{if(result.player)state.player=result.player;state.hasUnreadBalanceNotice=false;render();}).catch(error=>{console.warn("保存调整公告已读状态失败",error);});}
function openBalanceNotice(notice){if(!notice)return;state.selectedBalanceNotice=notice;state.balanceNoticeView="detail";state.scrollY=0;switchScreen("balanceNotices");markLatestBalanceNoticeRead(notice);}
function openBalanceNotices(){const notices=state.balanceNotices||{status:"ready",latest:null,items:[]};if(notices.status==="error"){wx.showToast({title:"卡牌调整公告加载失败，请稍后重试",icon:"none"});return;}if(!notices.latest){wx.showToast({title:"暂无卡牌调整公告",icon:"none"});return;}openBalanceNotice(notices.latest);}
function choosePurchase(){wx.showActionSheet({itemList:["购买 1 张","购买 5 张","购买 10 张","自定义数量"],success:result=>{if(result.tapIndex<3)return confirmPurchase([1,5,10][result.tapIndex]);wx.showModal({title:"自定义购买",editable:true,placeholderText:"请输入 1-99",success:modal=>{if(modal.confirm)confirmPurchase(Number(modal.content));}});}});}
function confirmPurchase(quantity){const count=Math.floor(Number(quantity));if(count<1||count>99){wx.showToast({title:"请输入 1-99",icon:"none"});return;}const cost=count*(state.shop.ticketPrice||100),coin=Math.max(0,Number(state.player.coin||0));if(coin<cost){wx.showModal({title:"金币不足",content:`当前金币 ${coin}，购买 ${count} 张抽卡券需要 ${cost} 金币。`,showCancel:false});return;}wx.showModal({title:"购买抽卡券",content:`消耗 ${cost} 金币购买 ${count} 张抽卡券？`,success:result=>{if(result.confirm)call(api.buyTickets(count),()=>wx.showToast({title:"购买成功",icon:"success"}));}});}
function claimOneMail(mailId){call(api.claimMail(mailId),()=>wx.showToast({title:"领取成功",icon:"success"}));}
function claimEveryMail(){if(!state.mail.length)return;call(api.claimAllMail(state.mail.map(item=>item.id)),result=>wx.showToast({title:`领取 ${result.granted.length} 封`,icon:"success"}));}
function claimTaskReward(data){call(api.claimTask(data.scope,data.taskId,data.bonus),()=>wx.showToast({title:"奖励已领取",icon:"success"}));}
function claimAllTaskRewards(scope){call(api.claimAllTasks(scope),result=>wx.showToast({title:`领取 ${result.claimed.length} 项`,icon:"success"}));}
function loadDecks(next){direct(api.loadDecks(),result=>{state.decks=result.slots||[];if(next)switchScreen(next);});}
function openDeck(slot){const deck=state.decks.find(item=>item.slot===slot);state.deckSlot=slot;state.deckDraft=cloneDeck(deck,slot);state.deckFilters={set:"all",rarity:"all",cost:-1};switchScreen("deckEditor");}
function renameDeck(){wx.showModal({title:"修改牌组名称",editable:true,placeholderText:state.deckDraft.name,success:result=>{if(!result.confirm)return;const name=String(result.content||"").trim().slice(0,12);if(!name){wx.showToast({title:"请输入牌组名称",icon:"none"});return;}state.deckDraft.name=name;render();}});}
function addDeckCard(data){const card=state.cards.find(item=>item.id===data.cardId),own=inventory(data.cardId);if(!card)return;let entry=deckEntry(data.cardId);if(!entry){entry={cardId:data.cardId,normalCount:0,shinyCount:0};state.deckDraft.cards.push(entry);}const total=entry.normalCount+entry.shinyCount;if(deckQuantity(state.deckDraft)>=20||total>=deckLimit(card))return;if(data.shiny&&entry.shinyCount<own.shinyCount)entry.shinyCount+=1;else if(!data.shiny&&entry.normalCount<own.normalCount)entry.normalCount+=1;render();}
function removeDeckCard(data){const entry=deckEntry(data.cardId);if(!entry)return;if(data.shiny&&entry.shinyCount>0)entry.shinyCount-=1;else if(!data.shiny&&entry.normalCount>0)entry.normalCount-=1;if(entry.normalCount+entry.shinyCount<=0)state.deckDraft.cards=state.deckDraft.cards.filter(item=>item.cardId!==data.cardId);render();}
function cycleDeckFilter(kind){if(kind==="set"){const values=["all",...state.sets.map(item=>item.id)],index=values.indexOf(state.deckFilters.set);state.deckFilters.set=values[(index+1)%values.length];}else if(kind==="rarity"){const values=["all",...RARITIES],index=values.indexOf(state.deckFilters.rarity);state.deckFilters.rarity=values[(index+1)%values.length];}else state.deckFilters.cost=state.deckFilters.cost>=10?-1:state.deckFilters.cost<1?1:state.deckFilters.cost+1;state.scrollY=0;render();}
function saveDeckDraft(){direct(api.saveDeck(state.deckSlot,state.deckDraft),result=>{const index=state.decks.findIndex(item=>item.slot===state.deckSlot);if(index>=0)state.decks[index]=result.deck;else state.decks.push(result.deck);state.deckDraft=cloneDeck(result.deck,state.deckSlot);wx.showToast({title:result.deck.valid?"牌组已保存":"已保存未完成牌组",icon:"none"});});}
function copyDeckDraft(){const empty=state.decks.filter(item=>item.slot!==state.deckSlot&&deckQuantity(item)===0);if(!empty.length){wx.showToast({title:"没有可用空槽位",icon:"none"});return;}wx.showActionSheet({itemList:empty.map(item=>`复制到牌组 ${item.slot}`),success:result=>{const target=empty[result.tapIndex];if(!target)return;const copy=cloneDeck(state.deckDraft,target.slot);copy.name=`${state.deckDraft.name}副本`.slice(0,12);direct(api.saveDeck(target.slot,copy),response=>{const index=state.decks.findIndex(item=>item.slot===target.slot);if(index>=0)state.decks[index]=response.deck;wx.showToast({title:`已复制到槽位 ${target.slot}`,icon:"none"});});}});}
function clearDeckDraft(){wx.showModal({title:"清空牌组",content:"将移除当前牌组的全部卡牌。",success:result=>{if(!result.confirm)return;direct(api.clearDeck(state.deckSlot),response=>{const index=state.decks.findIndex(item=>item.slot===state.deckSlot);if(index>=0)state.decks[index]=response.deck;state.deckDraft=cloneDeck(response.deck,state.deckSlot);state.scrollY=0;wx.showToast({title:"牌组已清空",icon:"none"});});}});}
function resetBattleSession(game){state.battle=game||null;state.battleConfirmed=cloneBattle(game);state.battleQueue=[];state.battlePending=0;state.battleQueueRunning=false;state.battleAiThinking=false;state.battleAiAction="";state.battleSpeed=1;state.battleReturn=null;state.battleGraveyard={open:false,side:"player",sort:{player:"desc",ai:"desc"},scroll:{player:0,ai:0},maxScroll:0,rect:null,entries:[],flashKey:"",flashUntil:0};}
function loadBattleSetup(){state.loading=true;state.error="";render();Promise.all([api.loadDecks(),api.battleStatus()]).then(([decks,battle])=>{state.decks=decks.slots||[];const incoming=battle.game||null;if((state.battle&&state.battle.id)!==(incoming&&incoming.id))resetBattleSession(incoming);else{state.battle=incoming;state.battleConfirmed=cloneBattle(incoming);}if(!state.battleSetup.slot){const valid=state.decks.find(item=>item.valid);state.battleSetup.slot=valid?valid.slot:0;}switchScreen("battleSetup");}).catch(error=>{state.error=cloudError(error);notifyError(state.error);}).finally(()=>{state.loading=false;render();});}
function startBattle(){if(!state.battleSetup.slot)return;direct(api.startBattle(state.battleSetup.slot,state.battleSetup.difficulty),result=>{resetBattleSession(result.game);state.mulliganSelected=[];clearBattleDrag();switchScreen("battle");});}
function cloneBattle(game){return game?JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(game)):null;}
function spendBattleMana(side,cost){let remaining=Number(cost)||0,useTemp=Math.min(Number(side.tempMana)||0,remaining);side.tempMana-=useTemp;remaining-=useTemp;side.mana=Math.max(0,(Number(side.mana)||0)-remaining);}
function optimisticGraveyard(side,card,reason){side.graveyard=Array.isArray(side.graveyard)?side.graveyard:[];const sequence=Math.max(0,...side.graveyard.map(item=>Number(item.graveyardSequence)||0))+1;side.graveyard.push({...detailSource(card),cardId:card.cardId||card.id,graveyardSequence:sequence,reason});}
function applyOptimisticBattle(action){
  const game=state.battle;
  if(!game||game.status!=="active")return;
  const player=game.player;
  if(action.type==="play"){
    const index=player.hand.findIndex(item=>item.instanceId===action.card.instanceId);
    if(index<0)return;
    const [card]=player.hand.splice(index,1);
    if(card.type==="coin"){
      player.tempMana=(player.tempMana||0)+1;
      return;
    }
    spendBattleMana(player,card.cost);
    if(card.type==="spell"){
      if((card.effects||[]).some(effect=>effect.action==="silence"&&effect.target==="all-enemy-minions")){
        for(const minion of game.ai.board){
          minion.keywords=[];
          minion.effects=[];
          minion.shield=false;
          minion.silenced=true;
        }
      }
      const selected=[...game.player.board.map(value=>({type:"minion",side:"player",value})),...game.ai.board.map(value=>({type:"minion",side:"ai",value})),{type:"hero",side:"player",value:game.player},{type:"hero",side:"ai",value:game.ai}].find(target=>target.type===action.targetType&&(target.type==="hero"?target.side===action.targetId:target.value.instanceId===action.targetId));
      for(const effect of card.effects||[]){if(effect.trigger!=="cast"||!String(effect.target||"").startsWith("selected-")||!selected)continue;if(effect.action==="damage"){selected.value.health-=Number(effect.value)||0;}else if(effect.action==="heal"){selected.value.health=Math.min(selected.value.maxHealth||selected.value.health,selected.value.health+(Number(effect.value)||0));}else if(effect.action==="silence"&&selected.type==="minion"){selected.value.keywords=[];selected.value.effects=[];selected.value.shield=false;selected.value.silenced=true;}}
      optimisticGraveyard(player,card,"spell");
      return;
    }
    const minion={...card,cardId:card.id,printedAttack:card.attack,printedHealth:card.health,baseAttack:card.attack,baseHealth:card.health,maxHealth:card.health,canAttack:(card.keywords||[]).includes("charge")||(card.keywords||[]).includes("rush"),rushOnly:(card.keywords||[]).includes("rush")&&!(card.keywords||[]).includes("charge"),attacksLeft:1,shield:(card.keywords||[]).includes("shield")};
    player.board.splice(Math.max(0,Math.min(player.board.length,action.position)),0,minion);
    return;
  }
  if(action.type==="attack"){
    const attacker=player.board.find(item=>item.instanceId===action.attackerId);
    if(!attacker)return;
    attacker.canAttack=false;
    attacker.attacksLeft=0;
    if(action.targetType==="hero"){
      game.ai.health-=attacker.attack;
      return;
    }
    const defender=game.ai.board.find(item=>item.instanceId===action.targetId);
    if(!defender)return;
    defender.health-=attacker.attack;
    attacker.health-=defender.attack;
    if(defender.health<=0){game.ai.board=game.ai.board.filter(item=>item!==defender);optimisticGraveyard(game.ai,defender,"death");}
    if(attacker.health<=0){player.board=player.board.filter(item=>item!==attacker);optimisticGraveyard(player,attacker,"death");}
    return;
  }
  if(action.type==="heroPower"){
    spendBattleMana(player,2);
    player.heroPowerUsed=true;
    game.ai.health-=2;
  }else if(action.type==="generalSkill"){
    spendBattleMana(player,3);
    player.generalSkillUsed=true;
    if(player.generalSkill==="heal-five")player.health=Math.min(30,player.health+5);
  }else if(action.type==="endTurn"){
    game.turn="ai";
    state.battleAiThinking=true;
  }
}
function battleAction(task,optimistic){state.showCardDetail=false;state.detailCard=null;state.detailHold=false;state.detailRect=null;state.battleSkillDetail=null;clearBattleDrag();if(!state.battleConfirmed)state.battleConfirmed=cloneBattle(state.battle);if(optimistic){const previous=cloneBattle(state.battle);applyOptimisticBattle(optimistic);detectGraveyardChange(previous,state.battle);}state.battlePending+=1;state.battleQueue.push({task,optimistic});render();runBattleQueue();}
function runBattleQueue(){if(state.battleQueueRunning||!state.battleQueue.length)return;state.battleQueueRunning=true;const item=state.battleQueue[0],request=typeof item.task==="function"?item.task():item.task;request.then(result=>{const finalGame=result.game;if(!item.optimistic)detectGraveyardChange(state.battleConfirmed,finalGame);state.battleConfirmed=cloneBattle(finalGame);state.mulliganSelected=[];state.battleQueue.shift();state.battlePending=Math.max(0,state.battlePending-1);if(item.optimistic&&item.optimistic.type==="endTurn")playAiEvents(finalGame&&finalGame.actionEvents||[],finalGame);else if(!state.battleQueue.length)state.battle=finalGame;}).catch(error=>{const message=cloudError(error);state.battleQueue=[];state.battlePending=0;state.battleAiThinking=false;notifyError(message);resyncBattle();}).finally(()=>{state.battleQueueRunning=false;render();runBattleQueue();});}
function playAiEvents(events,finalGame){const list=(events||[]).filter(item=>item.actor==="ai");if(!list.length){state.battle=finalGame;state.battleAiThinking=false;return;}state.battleAiThinking=true;let index=0;const next=()=>{if(index>=list.length){state.battle=finalGame;state.battleAiAction="";state.battleAiThinking=false;render();return;}const event=list[index++],actionDelay=(event.type==="attack"?800:600)/state.battleSpeed;setTimeout(()=>{const previous=state.battle;if(event.state){state.battle=event.state;detectGraveyardChange(previous,event.state);}state.battleAiAction=event.label||"对手行动";render();setTimeout(next,300/state.battleSpeed);},actionDelay);};next();}
function loadBattleHistory(){direct(api.battleHistory(),result=>{state.battleHistory=result.history||[];switchScreen("battleHistory");});}
function concedeBattle(){wx.showModal({title:"确认认输",content:"本场对局将记录为失败。",success:result=>{if(result.confirm)battleAction(api.battleConcede());}});}
function resetGame(){wx.showModal({title:"重置云端存档",content:"开发功能：恢复为全新账号状态并清空记录？",success:r=>{if(r.confirm)call(api.resetGameData(),result=>{state.player=result.player;state.signStatus={claimedToday:false,firstCycle:true,day:1,reward:state.config.signIn.firstCycle[0]};state.selectedPoolId="";wx.showToast({title:"已重置",icon:"success"});});}});}

function activate(x,y){const target=[...state.hit].reverse().find(a=>x>=a.x&&x<=a.x+a.w&&y>=a.y&&y<=a.y+a.h);if(!target||state.loading){if(state.screen==="battle"&&state.battleGraveyard.open&&!pointInRect(x,y,state.battleGraveyard.rect)){closeBattleGraveyard();render();}return;}const{id,data}=target;if(state.showCardDetail&&id!=="closeCardDetail")return;if(id==="closeCardDetail"){state.showCardDetail=false;state.detailCard=null;state.detailRect=null;state.detailHold=false;render();return;}if(id==="retry"){refresh(false);return;}if(!state.configReady&&!["home"].includes(id)){wx.showToast({title:"云配置未就绪",icon:"none"});return;}if(id==="selectPool")state.selectedPoolId=data;else if(id==="draw")doDraw(data);else if(id==="sign")state.showSign=true;else if(id==="history")loadHistory();else if(id==="adjustAnnouncement")openBalanceNotices();else if(id==="openBalanceNotice")openBalanceNotice((state.balanceNotices.items||[]).find(item=>item.id===data));else if(id==="balanceNoticeList"){state.balanceNoticeView="list";state.scrollY=state.balanceNoticeListScroll||0;render();return;}else if(id==="collection")switchScreen("collection");else if(id==="forge")switchScreen("forge");else if(id==="shop")switchScreen("shop");else if(id==="mail")switchScreen("mail");else if(id==="tasks")switchScreen("tasks");else if(id==="achievements")switchScreen("achievements");else if(id==="decks")loadDecks("decks");else if(id==="battleSetup")loadBattleSetup();else if(id==="battleHistory")loadBattleHistory();else if(id==="editDeck")openDeck(data);else if(id==="renameDeck")renameDeck();else if(id==="toggleDeckSkill"){state.deckDraft.generalSkill=state.deckDraft.generalSkill==="draw-two"?"heal-five":"draw-two";}else if(id==="copyDeck")copyDeckDraft();else if(id==="clearDeck")clearDeckDraft();else if(id==="cycleDeckFilter")cycleDeckFilter(data);else if(id==="addDeckCard")addDeckCard(data);else if(id==="removeDeckCard")removeDeckCard(data);else if(id==="saveDeck")saveDeckDraft();else if(id==="selectBattleDeck")state.battleSetup.slot=data;else if(id==="selectDifficulty")state.battleSetup.difficulty=data;else if(id==="startBattle")startBattle();else if(id==="continueBattle")switchScreen("battle");else if(id==="exitBattle")switchScreen("battleSetup");else if(id==="concedeBattle"||id==="battleConcede")concedeBattle();else if(id==="toggleMulligan")state.mulliganSelected=state.mulliganSelected.includes(data)?state.mulliganSelected.filter(item=>item!==data):[...state.mulliganSelected,data];else if(id==="confirmMulligan"){if(!state.battlePending)battleAction(api.battleMulligan(state.mulliganSelected));}else if(id==="battleHeroPower")battleAction(()=>api.battleHeroPower(),{type:"heroPower"});else if(id==="battleGeneralSkill")battleAction(()=>api.battleGeneralSkill(),{type:"generalSkill"});else if(id==="battleEndTurn")battleAction(()=>api.battleEndTurn(),{type:"endTurn"});else if(id==="battleSpeed")state.battleSpeed=state.battleSpeed===1?2:1;else if(id==="openBattleGraveyard"){state.battleGraveyard.open=true;state.battleGraveyard.side=data;}else if(id==="closeBattleGraveyard")closeBattleGraveyard();else if(id==="toggleGraveyardSort"){const side=state.battleGraveyard.side;state.battleGraveyard.sort[side]=state.battleGraveyard.sort[side]==="asc"?"desc":"asc";state.battleGraveyard.scroll[side]=0;}else if(id==="leaveBattle"){state.battle=null;state.battleConfirmed=null;state.battleQueue=[];state.battlePending=0;state.battleSpeed=1;closeBattleGraveyard();loadBattleSetup();}else if(id==="buyTicket")choosePurchase();else if(id==="claimMail")claimOneMail(data);else if(id==="claimAllMail")claimEveryMail();else if(id==="claimTask")claimTaskReward(data);else if(id==="claimAllTasks")claimAllTaskRewards(data);else if(id==="taskTab"){state.taskTab=data;state.scrollY=0;}else if(id==="home")switchScreen("home");else if(id==="filter")cycleCollectionFilter();else if(id==="workshop")doWorkshop(data);else if(id==="claimSign")claimSign();else if(id==="closeSign")state.showSign=false;else if(id==="closeResults"){state.showResults=false;state.results=[];}else if(id==="expandHistory")state.expandedHistory=state.expandedHistory===data?"":data;else if(id==="reset")resetGame();render();}

function beginBattleDrag(target,x,y){state.battleDrag={source:target.source,card:target.card,rect:{x:target.x,y:target.y,w:target.w,h:target.h},startX:x,startY:y,x,y,mode:"candidate",active:false,position:null,hover:null,submitted:false};}
function startBattleReturn(drag){if(!drag||!drag.active)return;state.battleReturn={card:drag.card,rect:drag.rect,fromX:drag.x,fromY:drag.y,toX:drag.rect.x+drag.rect.w/2,toY:drag.rect.y+drag.rect.h*.82,startedAt:Date.now()};}
function updateBattleDrag(x,y){const drag=state.battleDrag,game=state.battle;if(!drag||!game||drag.submitted)return false;drag.x=x;drag.y=y;const dx=x-drag.startX,dy=y-drag.startY;if(drag.mode==="candidate"&&Math.hypot(dx,dy)>8){clearLongPress();state.moved=true;if(drag.source==="hand"&&Math.abs(dx)>Math.abs(dy)*1.2&&Math.abs(dx)>10){drag.mode="scroll";}else{drag.mode=drag.source==="hand"?"play":"attack";drag.active=true;}}
  if(drag.mode==="scroll"){const delta=x-state.lastX;state.battleHandScrollX=Math.max(0,Math.min(state.battleHandMaxScroll,state.battleHandScrollX-delta));state.lastX=x;render();return true;}
  if(drag.mode==="play"){const rule=spellTargetRule(drag.card),zones=state.battleZones||{},targets=[zones.enemyHero,zones.ownHero,...(zones.enemyBoard&&zones.enemyBoard.rects||[]),...(zones.ownBoard&&zones.ownBoard.rects||[])].filter(Boolean),target=[...targets].reverse().find(item=>pointInRect(x,y,item));drag.overGraveyard=Boolean(state.battleGraveyard.open&&pointInRect(x,y,state.battleGraveyard.rect));drag.hover=!drag.overGraveyard&&rule&&target&&spellTargetMatches(rule,target)?{type:target.type,id:target.id,side:target.side,rect:target}:null;drag.center=!rule&&!drag.overGraveyard&&pointInRect(x,y,zones.centerPlay);drag.position=!rule&&!drag.overGraveyard&&drag.card.type==="minion"&&pointInRect(x,y,zones.ownBoard)?battleInsertPosition(game,x):null;if(rule&&target&&!drag.hover)state.battleNotice="该法术不能以此为目标";else if(rule&&pointInRect(x,y,zones.centerPlay))state.battleNotice="该法术需要选择目标";else state.battleNotice="";state.battleNoticeUntil=state.battleNotice?Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER:0;render();return true;}
  if(drag.mode==="attack"){const zones=state.battleZones||{},targets=[...(zones.enemyBoard&&zones.enemyBoard.rects||[]),zones.enemyHero].filter(Boolean),target=[...targets].reverse().find(item=>pointInRect(x,y,item)),context=dragAttackContext(game);drag.overGraveyard=Boolean(state.battleGraveyard.open&&pointInRect(x,y,state.battleGraveyard.rect));drag.hover=!drag.overGraveyard&&target&&legalBattleAttackTarget(game,target)?{type:target.type,id:target.id,rect:target}:null;if(target&&!drag.hover){state.battleNotice=context.guards.length?"只能攻击城墙随从":context.attacker&&context.attacker.rushOnly&&target.type==="hero"?"突袭随从本回合只能攻击随从":"";state.battleNoticeUntil=state.battleNotice?Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER:0;}else{state.battleNotice="";state.battleNoticeUntil=0;}render();return true;}
  return false;}
function finishBattleDrag(){const drag=state.battleDrag;if(!drag)return false;clearLongPress();state.battleDrag=null;state.battleNotice="";state.battleNoticeUntil=0;if(drag.submitted)return true;if(drag.mode==="play"&&(drag.position!=null||drag.center||drag.hover)){const position=drag.card.type==="minion"?(drag.position!=null?drag.position:state.battle.player.board.length):0,targetType=drag.hover&&drag.hover.type,targetId=drag.hover&&(drag.hover.type==="hero"?(drag.mode==="attack"?"hero":drag.hover.side):drag.hover.id);drag.submitted=true;battleAction(()=>api.battlePlay(drag.card.instanceId,position,targetType,targetId),{type:"play",card:drag.card,position,targetType,targetId});return true;}if(drag.mode==="attack"&&drag.hover){drag.submitted=true;const attackId=drag.hover.type==="hero"?"hero":drag.hover.id;battleAction(()=>api.battleAttack(drag.card.instanceId,drag.hover.type,attackId),{type:"attack",attackerId:drag.card.instanceId,targetType:drag.hover.type,targetId:attackId});return true;}if(drag.mode!=="candidate"&&drag.mode!=="scroll")startBattleReturn(drag);if(drag.mode!=="candidate")render();return drag.mode!=="candidate";}

